<LegalPage
  title="Privacy Policy"
  eyebrow="Privacy"
  description="How AllegrowAI handles personal information for its products, workflows, and transactional messaging."
>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    AllegrowAI may collect contact information, account information, product usage data,
    and technical information needed to operate products and workflows. When SMS
    verification is used, AllegrowAI may collect a phone number and related delivery
    metadata needed to send transactional verification messages.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <p>
    Information is used to provide products, authenticate users, protect accounts,
    operate infrastructure, respond to support requests, improve reliability, and meet
    legal or security obligations.
  </p>

  <h2>SMS and mobile information</h2>
  <p>
    AllegrowAI does not sell mobile phone numbers or SMS consent data. Mobile opt-in
    data and consent are not shared with third parties for their marketing or promotional
    purposes. SMS-related information may be shared with service providers such as
    telecommunications providers only as needed to deliver transactional messages,
    manage opt-out requests, prevent abuse, or comply with law.
  </p>

  <h2>Data sharing</h2>
  <p>
    AllegrowAI may share information with service providers that help operate the
    business, such as hosting, analytics, payment, communication, and security vendors.
    AllegrowAI may also disclose information when required by law or to protect users,
    the company, or the public.
  </p>

  <h2>Choices</h2>
  <p>
    Users may request access, correction, or deletion of personal information where
    applicable. SMS users may reply STOP to opt out of further messages or HELP for
    support information.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Privacy questions can be sent to
    <a href="mailto:john@allegrowai.com">john@allegrowai.com</a>.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
